<title>MALAYSIA: MOTORCYCLING-BIAGGI WINS 250CC MALAYSIAN GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-BIAGGI WINS 250CC MALAYSIAN GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>SHAH ALAM, Malaysia 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Max Biaggi, riding a Honda, won the 250cc race in the Malaysian Motorcycle Grand Prix in a time of 45 minutes 29.692 seconds on Sunday.</p>
<p>Japan's Tetsuya Harada, riding an Aprilia, finished second while France's Olivier Jacque, on a Honda, was third.</p>
